      <body><head><ref target="https://papyri.info/editions/sb/16/12641" n="645530"><title>ZPE 38 (1980), p. 274</title><date>1980</date></ref></head><div xml:lang="grc" type="edition" xml:space="preserve"><ab>
    <lb n="1"/>Ἡρακλείδης Ἀμμωνίου <expan>δημοσιώ<ex>νης</ex></expan> <expan>καταλοχ<ex>ισμῶν</ex></expan> <expan>Ἀρσι<ex>νοείτου</ex></expan> καὶ ἄλλω<unclear>ν</unclear> <expan>ν<supplied reason="lost">ο</supplied>μ<ex>ῶν</ex></expan> <expan>δι<ex>ὰ</ex></expan> Εὐδαίμ<unclear>ο</unclear><supplied reason="lost">νος</supplied> 

